{# ==========================================================================
   Template: maintenance_report.j2
   ===========================================================================
   Generates the Markdown maintenance report emailed after each pipeline run.

   Sections:
     1. Overall Result - aggregated status across all hosts
     2. Version Changes - BEFORE/AFTER table for kernel, HANA, OS
     3. Key Executable Versions - detailed per-binary comparison (kernel)
     4. Per-Host Status - rollback, Icinga health, critical services
     5. Follow-up Actions - conditional checklist based on failures

   Namespace variables (Jinja2 namespace for cross-loop state):
     ns.has_critical        - any host has unresolved Icinga alerts
     ns.has_rollback        - kernel rollback was performed
     ns.has_hana_failure    - HANA update failed
     ns.has_backup_failure  - HANA backup failed
     ns.total_patches       - total OS packages updated across all hosts
     ns.icinga_skipped      - Icinga checks were disabled for this run

   Input: hostvars from all play hosts (set by validation playbook)
   ========================================================================== #}
