## GLOSSARY

| Term | Explanation |
|------|-------------|
| **Kernel Patch Level** | Format: `<release> <patch>` (e.g., `7.77 1234`). Higher patch number = newer. |
| **Process Count (e.g., 11/11)** | SAP process status indicator. Format: "running/total". GREEN when all match (e.g., 11/11), WARNING otherwise. Click "Process Details" in Host Info report to see individual process states. |
| **Rollback** | Automatic restore of kernel backup when SAP start fails after update. |
| **Icinga Health Gate** | Pre-check that blocks maintenance if critical monitoring alerts exist. |
| **HANA Backup** | Full backup of SYSTEMDB + all active tenant databases before HANA update. |
| **Root Keys** | HANA encryption root keys backup password for data recovery. |

